//! `ui` — kit widgets on top of Zeus (Chip, Card, Alert, …).
//!
//! Example:
//! ```
//! import "std:zeus"
//! import "../../lib/ui.yuga"
//!
//! fn main() {
//!     ui.Card().child(
//!         ui.CardHeader(CardHeaderProps { title: "Hello", subtitle: "A short subtitle" }),
//!         ui.Chip(ChipProps { label: "live", color: theme.accent() }),
//!     ).run()
//! }
//! ```
//!
//! Size: `ui.sm` / `ui.md` / `ui.lg`. Look: `ui.solid` / `ui.soft` /
//! `ui.outline` / `ui.ghost` / `ui.danger`. Chain `.size()` / `.look()` after
//! the constructor. `Foo(props)` is medium + the widget's default look.
//! Each widget file holds its own `*Props` struct.

